cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this implementation report, please cite this repository together
  with the original ETNN paper and TopoBench.
title: >-
  From Equations to Code: Implementing E(n)-Equivariant Topological Neural
  Networks in TopoBench
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Khanal
    given-names: Gaurav
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-01
repository-code: https://github.com/grvkhnl/etnn-coordinate-policy
url: https://github.com/grvkhnl/etnn-coordinate-policy
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  A technical implementation report and validation record for a unified
  TopoBench-native ETNN backbone with explicit coordinate-free, structural
  Laplacian, and physical Euclidean coordinate policies.
keywords:
  - topological deep learning
  - equivariant neural networks
  - combinatorial complexes
  - ETNN
  - TopoBench
  - geometric deep learning
